  "description": "The notorious Empress Belita, famed for her myriad romantic entanglements!\n\nJust when Belita is on the verge of being killed by her tyrant husband while attempting to elope with a prince from a neighboring kingdom, \"I\" becomes Belita. \"I\"-now Belita-narrowly escapes death and vows to cease her unfaithful behavior to dispel the emperor's suspicions. \n\nAmidst a palace rife with numerous paramours, a distrustful emperor, and the looming specter of war, can Belita survive?\n\n(Source: POCKETCOMICS)\n\n*Note: First released in English, with the initial eligible release in Japanese followed by Korean, making it a manga by our standards.*",
